  "scope": "Joint parameter/local-state gradient extraction verified exact in TRAIN contract; same model/schedule/updates, removes duplicate cotangent backward. Boundary transport phase now excludes cotangent extraction, which shares local differentiation. Cost-only result must replay prior512forecast scores/acquisition. Bounded schedule: one aggregate causal receipt per32target actor update, full elapsed time/mark frequencies/mean observed loss retained, within-group ordering omitted. Native critic has two events (start plus receipt); future teaching every16updates during deployment, every update in TRAIN acquisition. Exact actor anchors retained: budget feasibility, not learned-credit replacement or efficiency win. Frozen-state verification uses one dictionary snapshot for every arm. Forecast factual law plus normalized counterfactual law response (162 scalars) added through zero-initialized 16-dimensional adapter to the same native hard-race critic. Extra factual replay and candidate replay charged. response_masked is a common-acquisition deployment-input ablation, not independently acquired state-only control. Existing full18,164parameter market predictor/checkpoint retained; new native hard-race prospective critic jointly learns a bounded positive Adam step multiplier across all actor parameters with future NLL plus0.05normalized exact-step deviation regularization, exact full boundary anchors, causal per-mark activation memory and forward-response-conditioned actual future-Adam teaching. No sampled residual credit; zero is genuine local-only learning. Common acquired actor/critic/optimizer state in all arms; Aug24 TRAIN acquisition, Aug25 DEV prequential adaptation with score before update. Full six-mark plus1us recording-cell timing objective. Dense temporal actor retained; native critic does not implement shared actor/critic bank reads or outcome-law posterior projection. No sealed TEST, cross-day/full-month, trading-profit, sparse hardware or benchmark win. Frozen critic still evolves numerical memory; fully_frozen freezes actor parameters too. All teacher/discovery/alternative/optimizer work included in measured execution."
